    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd6f\ufe0f YOIN: The Shadow of Dawn</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken without a voice. Without a body. Without time. Only one desire burns in your soul: <strong>to reclaim what was once your home.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world painted with ink and melancholy, you are a wandering spirit returning from the beyond to reclaim your village, now destroyed by invaders. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfae What is YOIN?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>YOIN: The Shadow of Dawn</strong> is a 2D top-down adventure and tactical action game set in a dreamlike feudal Japan. You are a ghost, invisible to humans, yet their life force hurts you. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd2e Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc7b <strong>Play as a vengeful spirit:</strong> invisible to the naked eye, but perceptible through your actions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd70\ufe0f Time is your enemy:</strong> you lose energy simply by existing in the world of the living.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udde1\ufe0f <strong>Reclaim your essence by defeating soldiers:</strong> only through killing do you recover life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3f <strong>Absorb energy from nature:</strong> trees, plants, and surrounding objects are your arsenal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Tactical stealth combat:</strong> your invisibility is your power, but also your vulnerability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcdc <strong>Fragmented narrative:</strong> explore ruins, shrines, and cemeteries to discover who you were\u2026 and why you came back.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\udde9 Experience-based progression:</strong> unlock abilities, improve attributes, and unveil your destiny.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf12 <strong>Hand-drawn art design:</strong> each area has a unique aesthetic inspired by Japanese mythology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>You are death returned.</u></strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Explore. Survive. Remember. Discover.</u></strong></h2>",
