your destiny.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf12 <strong>Hand-drawn art design:</strong> each area has a unique aesthetic inspired by Japanese mythology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>You are death returned.</u></strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Explore. Survive. Remember. Discover.</u></strong></h2>",
